# One player, a single race on track 0, the detail world (docs/port/DETAIL.md 6), the settings at original: the
# ground's visibility row lets four of the world's six parts through, and SYN_LOD is past its last level of detail.
# The car stands near the start for two seconds; tools/port/detail_check.py reads the exit's scene line.
# until: 0x400000:60
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --screenshot-at 1000 --screenshot detail.png
# check: tools/port/detail_check.py detail.log --level original --world 4 --lod-cut 1 --range 0 --radius 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning (0x40000000)
8 START        # the start prompt (4)
11 A           # the main menu (0x10): the race
14 A           # the player screen (0x20)
17 A           # the mode screen (0x40): a single race
20 A           # the track select (0x80): track 0
23 A           # the car select (0x100); then the race start, PrePlay, the countdown, the race
